                <invention-title lang="fr">AUTHENTIFICATION AMÉLIORÉE BASÉE SUR DES INTERACTIONS DE DISPOSITIF SECONDAIRE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ENHANCED AUTHENTICATION BASED ON SECONDARY DEVICE INTERACTIONS</invention-title>
